    <para>Lodge, A. C. &#38; Umberson, D. (2012). All shook up: Sexuality of mid- to later life married couples. <emphasis effect="italics">Journal of Marriage and Family, 74</emphasis>, 428&#8211;443. https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1741-3737.2012.00969.x</para>
